  "2026-07-26T00:58:27.183Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for GH-720,GitHub source install,committed build output,missing dist entry,and npm alternative diagnostics. Closed pm-59gj owns package-first installation,pm-ejy7 owns an npm runtime-loader defect,and pm-2p7a owns TypeScript loading,but none owns the current GitHub-copy source mismatch and actionable fallback; this distinct issue is linked under the SDK-first ecosystem epic pm-usfg."
